# Ignore everything by default (safeguard against accidental leaks)
/*

# Whitelist allowed repository root files & public skill package
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/README.es.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/SKILL/
!/SKILL/**
!/.github/
!/.github/**

# Operating system & temporary files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/*.tmp
**/.idea/**
**/.vscode/**
